      "subject": "feat(alignment): deliver B9 scheduling and opt-in Ask hosting",
      "body": "feat(alignment): deliver B9 scheduling and opt-in Ask hosting\n\nAlign the fixed cc-viewer baseline 74cd752 with native scheduled tasks,\nprivate definitions and run history, exact workspace dispatch, original UI,\nattachments, archive restoration, and optional server-side Ask hosting.\n\nIndependent tasks use AppServer to preserve native on-request approvals;\nresident transports and native approval reviewer behavior remain unchanged.\nAsk hosting is off by default.\n\nConsolidate 29 local implementation, verification, and audit commits.\nThe raw history is retained in backup/b9-raw-20261123 and a verified bundle.\nThe consolidated tree must equal original head 8dd6ebe exactly.\n\nValidation: 2443/2443 tests; build and pack747; fresh production install\n859/859 with exact package/Web bytes; actual native SDK/PTY probes and\nChromium/WebKit verification. Environment limitations remain documented.",
      "author": "weiesky.wangc <weiesky.wangc@antgroup.com>",
